---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Metroid Prime 4: Beyond — Should You Pre-order?"
  description="Metroid Prime 4: Beyond buying guide: platforms, editions, and where to find the cheapest pre-order or launch copy."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Metroid Prime 4: Beyond — Should You Pre-order?</h1>
    <p class="meta">Nintendo Switch · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Metroid Prime 4: Beyond</strong> is the long-awaited return of Samus
      Aran to the first-person Metroid formula, developed by Retro Studios. It's one
      of the most anticipated Switch releases of the generation.
    </p>

    <h2>What to expect at launch</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard edition</strong> — the full campaign, playable on any Switch model</li>
      <li><strong>Pre-order window</strong> — the first reliable buying opportunity; stock can tighten at launch</li>
      <li><strong>Physical vs digital</strong> — digital is instant and can't sell out; physical holds resale value</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Should you pre-order or wait?</h2>
    <p>
      For a game this anticipated, pre-ordering locks in a copy and avoids launch-day
      stock issues. Discounts on Nintendo first-party games are rare at launch, so
      there's little financial downside to buying early if you know you want it. Wait
      only if you want reviews first.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Metroid+Prime+4+Beyond+Switch"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
